- Route pattern: `requireAuthUser` (`src/lib/auth/session.ts`), `createSupabaseServerClient`, 
`src/lib/auth/authorize.ts`, `enforceRateLimit` (`src/lib/auth/rate-limit.ts`). DB integration suites invoke route 
handlers in-process (`vitest.messaging-db.config.mts`).
- No rich-text, sanitizer, Markdown-conversion, Anthropic, or OpenAI packages are installed; `zod 4.4.3` and 
`date-fns` are.
- E2E harness: `playwright.messaging-phase5.config.ts` (local-Supabase mode, real Chrome channel, server log capture) 
and `__tests__/api/playwright/helpers/local-supabase-mode.ts`; two-account fixtures from the messaging suites.
- Online target `vhabpcoyypobgasacsko`: not inspected yet (T8 does a read-only check; T15 the full preflight).
- None of these contradicts the SPEC.

