Apply, and usage route plus direct table/RPC access on the other company — all denied or empty; 
`supabase-rls-reviewer` audit.
Covers: FR-014, FR-015, FR-016, FR-017, FR-018, FR-019, FR-021, FR-022, FR-031, BR-006, BR-008, BR-013, AC-010, 
