38:    * the next offset. An empty query lists every note within the filters,
39:    * newest meeting first. Throws MeetingNoteDbError (MEETING_NOTE_SEARCH_INVALID).
40:    */
41:   searchNotes(input: MeetingNoteSearchInput): Promise<PaginatedResult<MeetingNoteSearchResult>>;
